OL,5,G0245 The New Statesman
OL,6,     FAfter surviving an attempt on his
OL,7,     Flife, Alan backs hanging but lands
OL,8,     Fon death row for a murder he did
OL,9,     Fnot commit.
OL,10,G0400 Agony
OL,11,     FLaurence's resolution to be a
OL,12,     Fmasterful husband backfires when
OL,13,     FJane decides to follow her own
OL,14,     Fadvice given to a woman caller:
OL,15,     Fleave him.
